[COBOL SEARCH ALL branches: 2/4 (50.0%), 1 counter file(s)
search-all.cob:15:0 SEARCHALL SEARCH ALL #0 WHEN 1: 1
search-all.cob:14:0 SEARCHALL SEARCH ALL #0 AT END: 0
search-all.cob:19:0 SEARCHALL SEARCH ALL #1 WHEN 1: 0
search-all.cob:18:0 SEARCHALL SEARCH ALL #1 AT END: 1
])
